---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Kile Research writes hands-on, reproducible guides to how AI models run, and helps small and mid-sized businesses adopt AI safely.">
  <div class="container section">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="overline">About</p>
      <h1>We measure before we claim</h1>
      <p class="lead">Kile Research publishes practical research on AI and LLM inference: how models actually run, what makes them fast or slow, and how to choose between options with data.</p>
      <h2>What we write</h2>
      <p>Our articles are for developers, IT and cloud teams, and curious learners with a beginner-to-intermediate grasp of AI. Each one teaches a single idea, takes a few minutes to follow, and ends with something you built and measured yourself.</p>
      <h2>How we work</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Every number is real.</strong> Commands and results come from our own test rig, with the hardware and versions stated. Anything we haven't run is labelled <em>untested</em>.</li>
        <li><strong>Everything is reproducible.</strong> Code and raw results live in our <a href={site.codeRepo} rel="noopener">public GitHub repository</a> under the MIT licence.</li>
        <li><strong>Facts and opinions stay separate.</strong> We say what we measured, what the docs say, and what we think it means.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Working with businesses</h2>
      <p>We also help small and mid-sized businesses put AI to work in a way that is measured, private and secure. <a href="/consulting/">See how we help</a>.</p>
      <h2>Spotted a mistake?</h2>
      <p>Tell us. <a href={`${site.codeRepo}/issues`} rel="noopener">Open an issue on GitHub</a> or <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>. We correct errors openly and note the update on the article.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  h1 { margin-block: var(--space-3) var(--space-4); }
  .prose .lead { font-size: var(--text-xl); }
</style>
